1
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:06,660
Did everything go okay with the annulment?
手續辦得還順利嗎？

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,230
No problems. It's all taken care of.
沒問題，都辦好了 

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,670
Ross,thank you.
羅斯，謝謝你

4
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,900
Want to go see a movie?
你們要不要去看電影 

5
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:15,100
Yeah,why not?
好啊

6
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:16,800
I'll get my sweater.
我去穿毛衣 好

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,810
Want to hear something weird?
想不想聽一件奇怪的事？ 

8
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,310
Always.
當然

9
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:27,080
I didn't get the annulment.
我沒去辦註銷

10
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,420
What?
什麼？ 

11
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,020
We're still married.
我們還是夫妻

12
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,490
Don't tell Rachel. See you later.
不要告訴瑞秋，待會見

13
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,830
Do you have any gum?
你有口香糖嗎？

14
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:45,770
Wait! Wait! Ross,can I just talk to you for just a second?
等等！ 羅斯，可以跟你談一下嗎？

15
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,700
We'll be late for the movie.
但是電影快開演了

16
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:49,770
There's a cab. Taxi!
那裡有計程車，計程車

17
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,100
That's great.

18
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:54,940
What timing! My God,huh? There you go.
來得正好，上車吧

19
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,350
We're gonna walk. It's right at the Angelika.
我們要走去前面的安潔麗戲院

20
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,990
The Angelika! Go! Go!
安潔麗戲院，開車

21
00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:04,020
You didn't get the annulment?!
你沒去註銷？ 

22
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,890
I know.
我知道

23
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:10,860
I tried,but when I got to my lawyer's office, all I heard was:
我試過，但在律師樓我只聽到

24
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:13,590
"Three divorces! Three divorces!"
「離婚三次，離婚三次」

25
00:01:13,770 --> 00:01:17,070
Yes,in that high voice.
沒錯，是女高音

26
00:01:17,270 --> 00:01:21,800
I just don't want my tombstone to read: "Ross Geller: Three Divorces."
我不希望我的墓碑上刻著 「羅斯蓋勒，離婚三次」

27
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:25,640
Don't worry about that. Your tombstone can say whatever you want.
你不必擔心那個 你愛刻什麼就刻什麼

28
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:28,580
It can say, "Ross Geller: Good at Marriage."
你可以刻 「羅斯蓋勒，婚姻高手」

29
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:33,950
You know? Mine's gonna say, "Phoebe Buffay: Buried Alive."
我的會刻 「菲比布非，活埋在此」

30
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:38,050
All I know is,I can't have another failed marriage.
反正我不能再添一次失敗婚姻

31
00:01:38,290 --> 00:01:42,160
So you're gonna be married to a girl who doesn't even know about it?
所以你要娶個不知情的女生？

32
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:44,230
Woman. Sorry.
女人，抱歉

33
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:49,240
Okay,so I don't have it all worked out quite yet.
我還沒想好要怎麼做 

34
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,840
Just don't say anything to Rachel.
拜託你先別告訴瑞秋

35
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:55,070
Rachel is one of my closest friends.
瑞秋是我最要好的朋友之一

36
00:01:55,310 --> 00:01:59,470
But being the only one that knows about this makes me feel special. Okay.
不過當唯一知情的人感覺不賴 好吧

37
00:02:02,450 --> 00:02:04,920
Okay,stop,stop! Phoebe?
停車 菲比？ 

38
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,520
Hey,Rach!
瑞秋

39
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:09,250
What was that?
你在搞什麼？ 

40
00:02:09,490 --> 00:02:11,080
Sorry. Mix-up.
抱歉，弄錯了

41
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:13,490
How was the movie?
電影好看嗎？ 

42
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:16,090
I haven't seen it yet.
我還沒看

43
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:18,460
You'd better hurry. The Angelika! Go!
那就要快了 安潔麗戲院，開車

44
00:02:19,272 --> 00:02:20,796
不…

45
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,100
The One Where Ross Hugs Rachel
本集播出：「瑞秋的反應」

00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,100
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

46
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:05,280
When I move in, can I get a gumball machine?
等我們同居 我可以買一台泡泡糖機嗎？

47
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:08,450
Of course. Joey wouldn't let you have one?
當然可以，喬伊不讓你買？

48
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:12,020
No, when it comes to sweets, he's surprisingly strict.
對，他對甜食要求特別嚴

49
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:15,110
Did you tell him you're moving out?
你想好要怎麼說了嗎？ 

50
00:03:15,390 --> 00:03:18,690
No,I keep trying. And I can get out,"Joey,I have to.."
還沒，我試了好幾次 我只能說出「喬伊，我得…」

52
00:03:18,930 --> 00:03:22,860
Then I lose my nerve and I finish with, "go to the bathroom."
然後就退縮改說「去上廁所」

53
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:24,930
He may think I'm sick.
他可能以為我有病

54
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:29,390
I have to tell Rachel,but.... We just gotta get it over with.
我真的得告訴瑞秋了 早死早超生

55
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:32,800
Next time we see them, we'll just tell them. That's it.
下次見到他們，我們就說

57
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:36,200
That's how it'll work now? You'll just order me around?
就這麼決定 以後你都要這樣指使我是吧？

59
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,940
-Pretty much. -All right.
差不多 好

60
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,110
Hey,man,you feeling better?
摩妮卡 你有沒有好一點？

62
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:49,750
We have something to tell you.
喬伊，我們有事要說

63
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:52,050
Oh,my God!
天哪

64
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:53,990
You're pregnant!
你懷孕了

65
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,290
No!
不是

66
00:03:57,503 --> 00:03:59,869
沒有吧？不是

67
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,940
Look, Joe,here's the thing.
喬伊，是這樣的

68
00:04:04,970 --> 00:04:08,740
Monica and I have decided to live together, here.
摩妮卡和我決定在這裡同居 

69
00:04:09,610 --> 00:04:11,600
I'm gonna be moving out, man.
所以我會搬出來

71
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:23,120
I'm really happy for you guys. Congratulations. See you later.
我真替你們高興 恭喜，回見

72
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,250
Are you okay?
等等，喬伊，你還好嗎？

73
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:27,930
I gotta go. I've got an acting job.
很好，我得走了，我有戲要演

74
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:31,330
Like you'd believe that.
你們會信才怪

75
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,360
This sucks!
討厭啦

76
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:37,500
I'll be across the hall. And I promise you...
我只是要搬到對門，我保證

77
00:04:37,710 --> 00:04:41,270
the minute Monica and I break up, I'm moving right back in.
摩妮卡和我一分手 我就回去跟你住

78
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:44,740
Maybe that's now.
你是說現在嗎？

79
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,270
If you're gonna move in with him...
好，如果你要跟他住 

80
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:50,850
I feel it is my responsibility to tell you the truth about him.
我有責任揭穿他的真面目

81
00:04:51,150 --> 00:04:53,250
He's a terrible roommate. Terrible.
他是個很爛的室友

82
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:55,180
He forgets to....
他會忘記…

83
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,490
He always,he always....
他老是…

84
00:04:59,590 --> 00:05:01,530
Who am I kidding? He's the best roommate!
我騙誰啊，他最棒了

85
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:08,700
-Hey,Phoebe. -Hey.
菲比

86
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:12,600
Oh, look, here's an article about people who marry people and don't tell them.
有一篇文章在討論 結了婚卻不告訴對方的人

87
00:05:12,770 --> 00:05:16,300
-Really? -Yeah, I'm reading Ross Geller Magazine.
真的？ 對，我在看羅斯蓋勒雜誌

88
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:19,600
Have you seen Rachel?
菲比，你有看到瑞秋嗎？

89
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:22,010
-No, why? -I have some exciting news.
沒有，怎樣？ 我有個好消息

90
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,680
You're pregnant.
你懷孕了

91
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:26,540
No!
不是

92
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:29,450
Chandler and I are moving in together.
錢德和我決定同居 

93
00:05:29,690 --> 00:05:31,250
Oh,that's good!
太好了

94
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:35,190
But if you were pregnant, what would you name it?  Hint,Phoebe.
不過如果你有寶寶要叫什麼？ 提示：菲比

95
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:40,360
What's up?
怎麼樣？

96
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:44,740
Chandler and I are moving in together.
錢德和我要住在一起

97
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:47,100
Oh,my God.
天哪 

98
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:50,970
Oh,my little sister and my best friend...
我妹妹和我的死黨…

99
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:52,800
shacking up.
搞在一起

100
00:05:54,550 --> 00:05:56,810
That's great. That's great.
太好了

101
00:05:57,490 --> 00:05:58,920
Guys, I'm happy too.
喂，我也很高興 

102
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,620
Okay,come here.
好，一起來

103
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:06,220
Big day,huh? People moving in. People getting annulled.
今天真熱鬧 有人要同居，有人辦註銷

104
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,260
I gotta go find Rachel.
我要去找瑞秋了，不過…

105
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:15,830
If you see her,give her some really bad news, so mine doesn't seem so bad.
你們能不能先灌些壞消息給她 減輕一些衝擊？

106
00:06:16,542 --> 00:06:17,600
再見

107
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:21,610
Something bad to tell Rachel.
講給瑞秋聽的壞消息…

108
00:06:23,410 --> 00:06:25,810
Bad news for Rachel. What could that be?
什麼是她的壞消息？

109
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:29,350
Can you just lay off, please?
你能不能別再提了？

110
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:34,150
My life is an embarrassment. I should just go live under somebody's stairs.
我的人生很難堪 我應該去住在別人的樓梯底下

111
00:06:34,990 --> 00:06:38,450
It's not that big a deal. You'll have been divorced three times.
根本沒那麼嚴重 離婚三次又怎樣

113
00:06:38,690 --> 00:06:40,750
You'll have a life,you'll date..
你還是會有私生活、會約會…

114
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:45,160
No, I won't. I'll be at the bottom of the dating barrel now.
才不會 我的約會指數降到谷底

115
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:48,160
The only guys below me will be Four-Divorce Guy...
比我低的只有離婚四次的人 

116
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,430
Murderer Guy...
殺人犯和…

117
00:06:50,670 --> 00:06:52,330
and geologists.
地質學家

118
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:57,700
Ross, you're being ridiculous. You are cute and smart and sweet.
羅斯，你別傻了 你可愛聰明又體帖

119
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:01,110
That is much more important than three stupid divorces.
這比離婚三次重要多了

120
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:04,340
Have you dated anyone who's been divorced three times?
是嗎？ 你交過離婚三次的男朋友嗎？

121
00:07:04,550 --> 00:07:08,890
That's not fair. Most guys that have been divorced three times are 60.
這樣問不公平 離三次婚的人通常都60了

122
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,390
You're young.
你多年輕啊

123
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:15,790
That's true,I am young.
我是很年輕

124
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,830
Well....

125
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:21,290
Nobody cares about this except you.
只有你自己在意 

126
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:24,840
This embarrassment thing is all in your head.
什麼難堪都是你在想像

127
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:28,570
-Here,I'll show you. Come here. -What?
我證明給你看 過來 幹嘛？

128
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:32,940
Hi. My friend Ross is about to be divorced for the third time.
我朋友羅斯即將三度離婚

130
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:34,670
But wouldn't you date him?
但你們會和他約會吧？

131
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:38,940
And if you wait right here, I'll go get Ross.
你們稍候，我去找羅斯來

132
00:07:43,890 --> 00:07:45,090
Thought you were Rachel.
我還以為你是瑞秋 

133
00:07:45,530 --> 00:07:47,360
What gave me away?
我哪裡露出破綻了？

134
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,190
I gotta tell her.
我得趕快告訴她

135
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,630
I told Ross and Phoebe. She's the only one left.
我已經告訴羅斯和菲比 只剩她了

136
00:07:51,870 --> 00:07:54,460
It's official. We're moving in together.
所以大家都知道了 我們確定要同居了

137
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:58,070
No turning back. Are you scared? Are you?!
不能反悔 你怕嗎？怕嗎？

138
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:00,300
No.
不怕

139
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,630
That was my scariest voice. You're brave.
那是我最可怕的聲音 你真勇敢

140
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,640
The worst day.
今天真慘

141
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:13,480
You're finally making progress at work, then your boss calls you Racquel.
你以為自己終於受重視了 結果老闆卻叫你拉蔻兒

142
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:18,820
Listen,for the first four years of my work, everybody called me....
我進公司前4年 大家都叫我夏拉拉

143
00:08:25,170 --> 00:08:27,160
-Seriously. -I believe you.
是真的 我相信

144
00:08:28,770 --> 00:08:32,600
It was in the middle of a meeting, so no one wants to correct her.
當時正在開員工大會 當然不會有人糾正她

145
00:08:32,810 --> 00:08:34,500
So everyone's calling me Racquel.
於是大家都叫我拉蔻兒

146
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:38,440
By the end of the day,the mailroom guys were calling me Rocky.
到了下班前 收發室的人已經叫成洛基了

147
00:08:40,110 --> 00:08:43,640
Well,I still think you're very,very nice and very pretty.
我還是覺得你很好很漂亮

148
00:08:44,650 --> 00:08:45,680
What?
什麼？

149
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:48,910
All yours, babe.
交給你了

150
00:08:49,829 --> 00:08:51,524
瑞秋，過來

151
00:08:51,930 --> 00:08:52,950
Have a seat.
坐

152
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,330
Listen,Chandler and I...
聽我說 錢德和我...

153
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:59,960
are going to live together.
要一起住在...

154
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,330
Here.
這裡

155
00:09:04,670 --> 00:09:05,830
Oh,my God.
天哪

156
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,870
That's so great!
真是太棒了

157
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:13,010
I'm so happy for you guys!
我真替你們高興

158
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:14,310
Really?
真的？

159
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,880
And that was so sweet of you to ask.
你真好，還先問我

160
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:21,020
The three of us are gonna have such a good time living together!
天哪 我們三個在一起一定會很開心

161
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:23,950
Yes,we are.
是啊

162
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:28,220
Chandler, you'll have to watch those long showers you take...
錢德，你早上不能慢慢沖澡了 

163
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:31,400
because you know Racquel can't be late.
因為拉蔻兒不能遲到

164
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:34,400
He'll work on that.
瑞秋 他會注意的

165
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,870
This is so exciting!
好興奮喔

166
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:43,340
Come and knock on our door
來敲我的門 （影集「三人行」主題曲）

167
00:09:45,650 --> 00:09:47,740
We'll be waiting for you
我們等著你

168
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:57,050
See? Once you know the stories, it's not that bad.
一旦知道內情就沒那麼糟了

169
00:09:57,260 --> 00:10:00,820
First marriage: Wife's hidden sexuality. Not my fault.
第一次，老婆隱瞞性向 不是我的錯

170
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,930
Second marriage: Said the wrong name at the altar.
第二次，宣誓時叫錯人 

171
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:06,890
A little my fault.
有一點點是我的錯

172
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:11,260
Third marriage: They shouldn't let you get married...
第三次 怎麼能讓...

174
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,910
when you're drunk and have writing on your face.
臉上塗鴉的醉鬼結婚

175
00:10:14,110 --> 00:10:15,670
Nevada's fault.
內華達州的錯

176
00:10:17,210 --> 00:10:21,170
So what do you think, ladies? Who wouldn't want to date him?
你們覺得怎樣？誰會沒興趣？ 誰會不想和他約會？

177
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,850
The divorces don't bother me. I'd date him.
離婚無所謂，我會和他約會 

178
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,590
But not while he's still married.
但他得先恢復自由身

179
00:10:25,850 --> 00:10:27,840
And you,wouldn't you want to date?
那你呢？你也想吧？

180
00:10:28,090 --> 00:10:30,060
I'm not dating at all anymore.
事實上我再也不約會了

181
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:32,890
I was only dating guys that were bad for me.
我老是看上對我不好的男人

182
00:10:33,130 --> 00:10:34,590
So I decided that..
在我解決這個… 

183
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,190
Good. Good. Whatever.
隨便啦

184
00:10:37,570 --> 00:10:38,590
And you,Meg?
梅格你呢？

185
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:41,600
Well,I don't care about the divorces, either.
我也不在意離婚的事 

186
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:43,960
But I wouldn't date him.
但我不會和他約會

187
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:47,940
Normally, he doesn't sweat this much.
他平常不會流這麼多汗

188
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:51,870
It's just that he's obviously still in love with this Rachel girl.
他顯然還愛著這個瑞秋 

189
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:53,240
What?
什麼？

190
00:10:53,410 --> 00:10:57,010
She said,"He's obviously still in love with this Rachel girl."
她說 「他顯然還愛著這個瑞秋」

191
00:10:59,850 --> 00:11:03,190
This is crazy. I mean, yes, Rachel is my good friend.
這話太扯了 沒錯，瑞秋是我的好朋友

192
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:06,050
And I have loved her in the past...
我過去確實愛過她 

193
00:11:06,290 --> 00:11:08,590
but now, she is just my wife.
但現在她只是我的妻子

194
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:13,030
Phoebe, will you help me out here?
菲比，幫我說句話好嗎？

195
00:11:13,230 --> 00:11:16,260
Well, I thought you loved her when you married her.
你娶她時我也以為你愛她

196
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:20,940
We were drunk! I would've married Joey with that amount of alcohol.
我們喝醉了 喝那麼多我連喬伊都會娶

197
00:11:21,940 --> 00:11:24,640
You could do a lot worse than Joey Tribbiani!
比喬伊崔比亞尼爛的人多得是

198
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:28,980
I'm sorry, but you guys are wrong.
很抱歉，但是你們錯了 

199
00:11:29,220 --> 00:11:32,450
I just don't want to be divorced three times.
我只是不想離三次婚

200
00:11:32,650 --> 00:11:34,950
Now he's using this three-divorces reason...
沒錯，他以此為藉口...

201
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:38,450
because he wants to stay married to her because he loves her.
不想離婚 因為他愛她

202
00:11:38,730 --> 00:11:41,160
I must say, well done. Bravo,Meg.
我必須說：梅格，幹得好

203
00:11:42,830 --> 00:11:45,820
Fine. If this is what you think, forget about...
好，如果你們這麼想 

204
00:11:46,070 --> 00:11:47,590
the whole three-divorce thing.
那我就不管了

205
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:52,140
I'll go to my lawyer's office right now and get this marriage annulled.
我現在就去找律師辦註銷

206
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:54,000
She means nothing to me.
因為我一點也不愛她 

207
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,140
Nothing!
一點也不愛

208
00:11:57,980 --> 00:12:01,740
Okay, now I wouldn't date you because you seem a little creepy.
現在是你的神經質讓我發毛

209
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:04,340
I am so attracted to him right now.
我突然覺得他好有魅力

210
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,590
When will we tell Rachel what actually will happen?
我們什麼時候要跟瑞秋說實話

211
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:13,750
Soon.
快了

212
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,790
I just couldn't before. You saw how upset Joey got.
我剛才說不出口 你也看到喬伊多難過

213
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,330
I couldn't do it. She's my best friend.
我不忍心傷害我最好的朋友

214
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,020
Joey's my best friend.
喬伊也是我最好的朋友

215
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,860
I'm not your best friend?
我不是嗎？

216
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,600
You just said..
你自己剛才說…

217
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:30,330
Of course you're my best friend.
你當然是

218
00:12:31,310 --> 00:12:32,540
Would you tell Rachel?
但請你告訴瑞秋好嗎？

219
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:35,940
All right. At least I'm prepared.
好啦，至少我現在有準備 好

220
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:39,050
Oh,yes.
漂亮

221
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:43,790
-They're not for you. Are you upset? -I am now.
不是給你的，你有不開心嗎？ 現在有了

222
00:12:46,690 --> 00:12:48,130
Hey,roomie.
室友 

223
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:50,190
Okay,bye.
好，再見

224
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:58,830
There's something important I have to tell you.
瑞秋，我有重要的事要告訴你

225
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,340
Are you pregnant?
你懷孕了？

226
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:03,480
No, but I'm throwing this shirt away.
沒有，但我要扔掉這件衣服

227
00:13:05,250 --> 00:13:08,480
I think there was a little misunderstanding before.
剛才有一些誤會

228
00:13:09,050 --> 00:13:14,080
When I said that Chandler and I wanted to live together...
我說錢德和我想住在一起

229
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:17,520
we meant alone together.
意思是只有我們兩個人

231
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:24,730
Oh,my God. That's funny. I can't believe I did that.
天哪，真好笑，我居然會誤會

232
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,700
No, sweetie. You know what? This is my fault.
不，是我不好 

233
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:29,530
I wasn't clear.
我沒說清楚

234
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:31,760
I'm really sorry.
真的很抱歉

235
00:13:32,510 --> 00:13:35,940
Listen,you take as much time as you need to move out, okay?
你可以慢慢找房子 

236
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:37,910
There's absolutely no rush.
一點也不用急

237
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:40,380
Okay.
好

238
00:13:43,856 --> 00:13:45,380
好

239
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:48,910
Don't you want a cookie?
你不吃餅乾嗎？

240
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,020
Sure.
好啊

241
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,620
Thanks.
謝謝 

242
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:56,230
Do you need a tissue?
需要面紙嗎？

243
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:02,790
-Where did you get these? -I made them.
這是哪裡的餅乾？ 我做的

244
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:05,730
Oh, God, they're so yummy!
天哪，真好吃

245
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:11,270
-Okay, whose is this? -That's mine.
這是誰的？ 我的

246
00:14:11,450 --> 00:14:13,780
-And what about this? Whose is this? -That's mine.
那這個呢？ 也是我的

247
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:17,210
Okay, whose dishwashing soap is this?
那這罐洗碗精呢？

248
00:14:17,380 --> 00:14:20,720
That was here when we moved in.
我們搬進來時就有了

249
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:25,290
Oh,I guess it really is concentrated.
難怪濃成這樣

250
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:31,490
It's gonna be weird when I come home and you're not here.
以後我回家你就不在了

251
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,530
No more Joey and Chan's.
沒有喬伊和錢德家了 

252
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:35,960
No more J and C's.
沒有喬和錢家了

253
00:14:36,370 --> 00:14:39,640
Want to go to Joey and Chandler's? Can't. It's not there.
「要不要去喬伊和錢德家？」 「不行，已經不在了」

254
00:14:40,570 --> 00:14:43,980
I'll be across the hall. We can still do all the same stuff.
我只是搬到對面 我們還是可以跟以前一樣

255
00:14:44,210 --> 00:14:47,040
We won't be able to have those long talks at night...
但以後就不能半夜起來 

256
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:49,220
about our feelings and the future.
促膝長談感覺和未來了

257
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,840
Not once did we do that.
我們一次也沒做過

258
00:14:52,990 --> 00:14:56,720
Don't you remember that night, it was late and I was feeling sick...
不是有一次很晚了，我不舒服

259
00:14:56,890 --> 00:15:01,890
and you said I would feel better tomorrow?
你說我「明天」就會好一點？

260
00:15:02,060 --> 00:15:03,760
Oh, yeah. I remember that.
對，我記得

261
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:08,030
I don't know. I'm just gonna miss living with you.
我會想念那些事 

262
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,230
Yeah,me too,man.
我也是

263
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,900
-What the hell is that? -That's disgusting.
那是什麼？ 好噁心

264
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:20,610
I told Rachel that it's just gonna be the two of us.
我告訴瑞秋我們要自己住了 

265
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:23,180
Oh,yeah? Well,how'd she take it?
是嗎？她還好嗎？

266
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:24,950
Really well.
非常好

267
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:27,280
Surprisingly well.
令人意外的好

268
00:15:27,550 --> 00:15:30,790
She didn't cry. She wasn't angry or sad.
沒有哭，也沒有生氣或難過

269
00:15:33,690 --> 00:15:37,130
And you're upset because you didn't make your best friend cry?
你很不爽沒把手帕交弄哭？

270
00:15:37,930 --> 00:15:40,260
All I'm asking for is a little emotion.
我只求一點真情流露 

271
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:42,590
Is that too much to ask after six years?
我們6年室友耶

272
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:45,600
What,are Rachel and l not as close as you guys?
我們沒你們要好嗎？ 

273
00:15:45,810 --> 00:15:49,940
I mean,did we not have as much fun? Don't I deserve a few tears?
沒你們開心嗎？ 我不值得她掉幾滴淚嗎？

275
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:53,370
When we told Joey, he cried his eyes out.
喬伊一聽到就哭得死去活來

276
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:57,380
I did not cry my eyes out!
我才沒有哭得死去活來

277
00:15:57,950 --> 00:16:00,080
Come on, it's like the end of an era.
這就像一個時代的結束 

278
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:02,220
No more J-Man and Channy's!
再也沒有喬兄和錢哥了

279
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:06,450
Okay,I gotta ask,who calls us that?
我一定要問 有誰那樣叫我們？

280
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:15,300
You got married again?
你又結婚了

281
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,430
Yes.
對

282
00:16:18,340 --> 00:16:21,830
So that's your second marriage in two years?
這是你2年內第二次結婚

283
00:16:22,110 --> 00:16:24,410
Yes. Second in two years.
對，2年兩次

284
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:26,980
Third,overall.
總共三次

285
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:30,480
I have been a divorce attorney for 23 years...
羅斯，我當了23年離婚律師 

286
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:33,810
and never have I had so much business from one client.
沒有一個客戶比你捧場

287
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,590
Why don't you tell me what happened?
告訴我怎麼回事

288
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:43,290
Basically,Rachel and I were in Vegas,a nd we got drunk.
基本上，瑞秋和我在賭城 我們喝醉了…

289
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:46,860
I'm sorry, is this the same Rachel whose name you said...
抱歉，她就是你上次結婚 

290
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:48,970
at the altar in the second marriage?
叫錯的那個瑞秋？

291
00:16:49,170 --> 00:16:50,860
Yes,yes,yes.
對

292
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:53,170
But I do not love her.
但是我並不愛她

293
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,300
That's better then.
這就好多了

294
00:16:57,780 --> 00:17:01,210
This was just a drunken mistake, and I need to get it annulled.
這只是酒醉犯錯，我要辦註銷 

295
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,540
I see.
我懂了

296
00:17:03,050 --> 00:17:05,640
Have you considered therapy?
你考慮過接受治療嗎？

297
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:11,350
I think just the annulment for today.
我想今天辦註銷就好了

298
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:13,960
-There are some forms to fill out. -Easy.
要填幾份表格 簡單

299
00:17:14,230 --> 00:17:18,630
We'll need witnesses who can testify that you were not of sound mind.
必須有證人證明 你們當時神智不清

300
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:20,700
No problem.
沒問題

301
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:24,130
We'll need you and Rachel to testify before a judge.
你和瑞秋得向法官說明

302
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:30,070
There's no way to do this without her?
不能不找她嗎？ 

303
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:34,210
Because I kind of already told her it was taken care of.
我已經告訴她事情都辦妥了

304
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:36,410
Of course you did.
你當然這麼說

305
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:42,690
Look, you can't get an annulment unless you and Rachel are both there.
羅斯，你和瑞秋都在場 才能辦理註銷

306
00:17:44,530 --> 00:17:47,650
What about someone who looks like Rachel?
那找一個長得像瑞秋的人呢？

307
00:17:49,230 --> 00:17:51,200
I will think about the therapy.
我會考慮接受治療

308
00:17:58,910 --> 00:18:03,240
So I was thinking that maybe we should start dividing up our stuff.
我想我們應該開始分東西了

309
00:18:03,940 --> 00:18:05,340
Okay.
好

310
00:18:05,910 --> 00:18:07,780
No point in dragging it out.
沒必要拖拖拉拉的

311
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:11,510
Dragging out the long process of you moving out...
我是說你搬走

312
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:13,850
and us not living together anymore.
我們分開的事

313
00:18:14,326 --> 00:18:15,623
好

315
00:18:20,930 --> 00:18:23,450
What about this? Who gets this?
瑞秋，這個要歸誰？

316
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:27,430
I don't know if I want it because it might be too many memories.
我不知道我想不想要 它有太多回憶

317
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:30,630
-What is that? -I don't know.
那是什麼？ 我不知道

318
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:37,040
How about this? I want you to have the big plate.
瑞秋，大盤子呢？ 我要你留著大盤子

319
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:41,310
Wow, Monica, thanks. I love this plate.
謝謝，我很喜歡這個盤子

320
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,450
Something to remember me by.
這樣你就會記得我

321
00:18:45,750 --> 00:18:48,380
Mon, you're not dying. I'm just moving out.
你又不是快死了 我只是要搬出去

322
00:18:49,320 --> 00:18:51,810
We're gonna see each other all the time.
我們還是會天天見面

323
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,990
But still,it's a big change.
但這是個大轉變 

324
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:58,430
The end of an era, you might say.
甚至是一個時代的結束

325
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:03,170
Are you okay? You're not blinking.
你還好嗎？眼睛都沒眨

326
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:08,570
I'm fine. I was thinking about how it's an end of an era.
我很好 我只是在想一個時代要結束了

327
00:19:09,010 --> 00:19:10,600
Oh,all right.
好吧

328
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:16,640
But I gotta say, I don't think six years counts as an era.
但老實說 6年應該稱不上一個時代

329
00:19:16,950 --> 00:19:19,780
An era is defined as a significant period of time.
一個時代就是一段重要的日子

330
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:23,420
It was significant for me. Maybe it wasn't significant to you!
我覺得重要 或許你不覺得重要

331
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:27,030
-What is the matter with you? -What is the matter with you?!
你是怎麼了？ 你才怎麼了？

332
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:30,020
Why aren't you more upset?
你為什麼沒有更不開心？ 

333
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:33,320
Aren't you gonna be sad that we're not living together?
我們要分開了你不難過嗎？

334
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:35,530
Aren't you gonna miss me at all?
你都不會想我嗎？

335
00:19:35,870 --> 00:19:38,700
Monica, all right. But don't get mad at me.
好吧，說出來你別生氣

336
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,030
It's just a little hard to believe.
我只是有點難以相信 

337
00:19:43,810 --> 00:19:45,210
What's hard to believe?
難以相信什麼？

338
00:19:45,450 --> 00:19:49,640
I mean,it's you guys. You do this kind of stuff,you know?
你們啊，你們就是這樣

339
00:19:49,850 --> 00:19:53,950
You were gonna get married in Vegas, and then you backed out.
你們在賭城說要結婚又不結了

340
00:19:54,190 --> 00:19:58,630
I'm not upset because I don't see you going through with it. I'm sorry.
我並不認為你們會真的同居 對不起

342
00:20:04,730 --> 00:20:06,700
It's going to happen.
瑞秋，事情已經確定了

343
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:08,530
Chandler will move in here.
錢德會搬進來

344
00:20:08,740 --> 00:20:11,640
-But I.. -I know,just let me finish, okay?
但是… 你先聽我說完

345
00:20:12,570 --> 00:20:16,340
This isn't something that we just impulsively decided to do in Vegas.
這不是在賭城的一時衝動 

346
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:19,070
This is something that we both really want.
我們真的想要住在一起

347
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:23,250
And it is going to happen.
我們會住在一起 

348
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,480
It is?
是嗎？

349
00:20:27,650 --> 00:20:28,990
Really?
真的？ 

350
00:20:29,390 --> 00:20:31,080
Yeah,sweetie.
沒錯

351
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:36,760
You mean,we're not gonna live together anymore?
我們不能再住在一起了？

352
00:20:38,237 --> 00:20:39,795
不行了

353
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:45,200
Oh,my God. I'm gonna miss you so much.
天哪，我會好想你 

354
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:47,200
I'm gonna miss you.
我也是

355
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,100
I mean, it's the end of an era!
這是一個時代的結束 

356
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:51,870
I know!
我知道

357
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:57,750
-Okay, bye. -Oh,no.
再見 又來了

358
00:20:58,450 --> 00:21:00,750
So did you get the annulment?
你去辦註銷了嗎？ 

359
00:21:00,950 --> 00:21:04,080
-I couldn't. -I knew it. Because you love Rachel.
我辦不了 我就知道，因為你愛瑞秋

360
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:07,860
It's not that. Annulments are more complicated..
不是那樣的 事情比想像中複雜…

361
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:10,290
Complicated because of the love.
愛讓它變得複雜

362
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:13,360
I do not love Rachel.
我不愛瑞秋

363
00:21:13,630 --> 00:21:15,530
I'm telling her about the whole thing...
我現在就去告訴她 

364
00:21:15,770 --> 00:21:19,030
so we can get this marriage annulled as fast as possible.
好盡快把手續辦好

365
00:21:19,270 --> 00:21:21,210
Would I do that if I loved her?
我如果愛她會這麼做嗎？

366
00:21:21,410 --> 00:21:24,400
I've never been more convinced of your love for her.
我現在更確信你愛她

367
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:28,870
I do not have feelings for Rachel, okay?
我對瑞秋沒有感覺，好嗎？

368
00:21:32,050 --> 00:21:34,420
Oh,what's wrong?
怎麼了？

369
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:37,650
Monica and Chandler are moving in here...
摩妮卡和錢德真的要同居了 

370
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:40,620
and I have to move out and everything is changing.
我得搬出去，一切都要變了

371
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:44,320
Oh, my God, come here, come here. It's okay.
過來，別難過，不會有事的

372
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:46,830
Everything's gonna be okay.
不會有事的

373
00:21:47,100 --> 00:21:50,130
-Thank you. -Of course.
謝謝你 不客氣

374
00:22:00,050 --> 00:22:03,350
So Ross and Rachel got married.
羅斯和瑞秋結婚了 

375
00:22:03,850 --> 00:22:06,340
Monica and Chandler almost got married.
摩妮卡和錢德差點結婚

376
00:22:06,850 --> 00:22:08,450
You think we should hook up?
我們要不要送做堆？

377
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:11,790
Oh,we do.
要

378
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:13,490
But not just yet.
但不是現在

379
00:22:14,860 --> 00:22:16,950
Really? Well,when?
是嗎？那是什麼時候？

380
00:22:19,970 --> 00:22:22,900
Well, first Chandler and Monica will get married...
好，首先錢德和摩妮卡會結婚 

381
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:25,400
and be filthy rich,by the way.
還會發大財

382
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:27,130
But it won't work out.
但婚姻會破裂

383
00:22:27,870 --> 00:22:28,970
I know.
天哪 是啊

384
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:32,910
Then I'll marry Chandler for the money.
然後我會為錢嫁給錢德

385
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:36,580
And you'll marry Rachel and have the beautiful kids.
你會娶瑞秋生幾個漂亮小孩 

386
00:22:36,820 --> 00:22:38,150
Great.
太好了

387
00:22:38,890 --> 00:22:41,320
But then we ditch them and we get married.
接著我們就拋棄他們結婚

388
00:22:41,990 --> 00:22:44,550
We'll have Chandler's money and Rachel's kids.
我們會有錢德的財產 瑞秋的孩子

389
00:22:44,830 --> 00:22:48,760
Getting custody will be easy because of Rachel's drinking problem.
監護權很好搶，因為瑞秋酗酒

390
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:51,160
What about Ross?
那羅斯呢？ 

391
00:22:51,370 --> 00:22:53,490
I don't want to go into the whole thing.
我不想多說，不過…

392
00:22:53,770 --> 00:22:55,670
But we have words and I kill him.
我們吵架，我殺了他

393
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


394
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
